## 2. “Stradivarius” / Stradivari-model instruments — commercially buyable replicas (retail)

These are **not** by Antonio Stradivari; they are modern copies or models marketed with Stradivari association. Prices were reported on merchant pages at research time — **confirm live price and stock**.

- Amati’s Fine Instruments — Antonio Stradivari 1703 replica (sizes including 1/4–4/4; listed ~USD 3,900 on product archetype): https://amatisonline.com/shop/orchestral-instruments/violins/antonio-stradivari-1703-replica-1-4-violin/
- Amati’s Fine Instruments — “Red Violin” replica, Stradivari model (~USD 4,200): https://amatisonline.com/shop/orchestral-instruments/violins/red-violin/
- Antonio Violins — Stradivarius 1703 replica, 4/4 (~USD 3,900): https://antonioviolins.com/product/stradivarius-1703-replica/
- Kolstein Music — “Stradivarius Copy Violin” (price shown in CHF on site; availability may vary): https://kolstein.com/products/stradivarius-copy-violin
- Miami String Haus — 1732 Stradivarius violin copy, 4/4 (~USD 5,800): https://miamistring.com/products/1732-stradivarius-violin-copy-4-4-size

