## 4. Practical notes for an actual purchase

- Expect **seven- to eight-figure USD** for authenticated golden-period examples at open auction; violas and exceptional provenance can exceed that band.
- Always work with **independent expert authentication** (certificates, dendrochronology where applicable, condition reports) and legal counsel for high-value cultural property.
- Many true sales are **private** and never appear on public retail sites; the dealers and houses above are the realistic entry points.
